 is required for this declared-entry assessment; source discovery remains not-tested and no repository-wide completeness claim is made.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The CreateMemoShare handler obtains the current user, rejects an unauthenticated nil user, resolves the requested memo, and proceeds through authorization checks before the share-creation call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":25,"endLine":31}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization helper treats a user as eligible only when active and allows either matching creator identity or the administrator role.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-34c8331239a9d018","startLine":83,"endLine":85}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler extracts the memo identifier from the request and obtains the selected memo through the store lookup, treating an empty result as not found.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":37,"endLine":47},{"sourceId":"src-b8116a78be57bdb7","startLine":232,"endLine":242}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The handler invokes CanManageMemo and denies the operation when that author-or-administrator control is false; CanManageMemo requires a memo and delegates to the active-user author-or-administrator test.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":48,"endLine":53},{"sourceId":"src-34c8331239a9d018","startLine":73,"endLine":75}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After authorization and audience checks, the handler constructs a share policy and invokes the protected share-creation store operation using the memo and caller identifiers.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":66,"endLine":77}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler separately rejects inactive memos and SPACE-audience memos before creating the share.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startL